                      (    forth6809.asm):07624         ; own, conceptually correct constant rather than the numerically-
                      (    forth6809.asm):07625         ; equal PADOFFSET).
                      (    forth6809.asm):07626         ;
                      (    forth6809.asm):07627         ; WORDLISTS (16.3.2, Search-Order word set) is deliberately absent
                      (    forth6809.asm):07628         ; from ENVTABLE, not an oversight - this system doesn't implement
                      (    forth6809.asm):07629         ; the Search-Order word set, so WORDLISTS is genuinely an unknown
                      (    forth6809.asm):07630         ; attribute here. Per ENVIRONMENT?'s own spec (6.1.1345): "If the
                      (    forth6809.asm):07631         ; system treats the attribute as unknown, the returned flag is
                      (    forth6809.asm):07632         ; false" - falling through to ENVNOTFOUND already produces exactly
                      (    forth6809.asm):07633         ; that, correctly and completely, with no dispatcher work needed.
                      (    forth6809.asm):07634         ; Confirmed via MAME testing.
                      (    forth6809.asm):07635         ;
                      (    forth6809.asm):07636         ; MAX-D/MAX-UD were resolved this session via a genuine dispatcher
