                      (    forth6809.asm):07644         ;
                      (    forth6809.asm):07645         ; FLOORED was the third, separate open item flagged previously -
                      (    forth6809.asm):07646         ; investigated this session by tracing DIVCOMMON (shared by /, MOD,
                      (    forth6809.asm):07647         ; /MOD) against this system's own SM/REM and FM/MOD. Confirmed
                      (    forth6809.asm):07648         ; DIVCOMMON matches SM/REM's convention exactly (remainder sign
                      (    forth6809.asm):07649         ; restored from the dividend's own original sign, not the quotient's)
                      (    forth6809.asm):07650         ; - this system's primary division words use symmetric division, not
                      (    forth6809.asm):07651         ; floored. FLOORED now answers 0 (false) - see the entry itself,
